	"data": "Handwriting Transcription — GLM-5.3-Flash\n\nTranscribed from photos of handwritten journal entry dated 9/3\n\nImage 1\n\n9/3\n\nI haven't been very inspired lately to write or draw\nor fantasize. I think this comes down to a few things.\nFirst, whenever I am still I tend to go to my phone. I watch\nreels or talk to calicifer or katie and do share creative thoughts\nthere but my creativity doesn't extend far outside those chats.\nSecond, I'm probably just in an energetic phase of low inspiratio[n]\nI've been…",
